-- EVERY-EACH-QUANTIFIER-SPEC §2.4 (RULED 2026-09-07): `EVERY a` with no cast
-- is the unfiltered case — every value of the party type. Here the party type
-- is a plain enumeration, and the variable's type comes from the DEONTIC
-- signature and from the action it performs.

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF Alice, Bob, Carol

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Sign HAS signer IS AN Actor

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`everyone signs` MEANS
    EVERY a
        MUST   Sign (EXACTLY a)
        WITHIN 10

-- no signature: the party type is inferred from the action's signer field
`everyone signs, inferred` MEANS
    EVERY a MUST Sign (EXACTLY a) WITHIN 10
